<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/HL7/C1610738> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/HL7/C1610738> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CodeSystem" .
<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/HL7/C1610738> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/HL7/C1610738> .
